.envrc
bin/

# The attendance workbook the rota is EXPORTED to, and the working copy it is built
# from. Deliberately not tracked: it carries real staff names, and the application
# does not read it at all.
#
# What the binary embeds is internal/report/templates/attendance.xlsx, a template
# with every date, time and person name stripped. Nothing at runtime touches this
# folder, so tracking it would put a roster of real people into the repository for
# no benefit.
rota/